WEBVTT

00:34.740 --> 00:36.820
<i>Raga, return the
Sacred Dragon Stone'.!</i>

00:57.220 --> 00:59.350
It looks like it's
going to be noisy.

02:37.150 --> 02:41.500
<i>Episode 1 Tragedy
in the Hidden Village.</i>

02:41.530 --> 02:43.130
<i>Episode 1 Tragedy in the Hidden
Village Where are you gdmg, Raga'?</i>

02:43.160 --> 02:43.340
<i>Where are you going, Raga'?</i>

02:43.370 --> 02:48.790
It is the fate of the Hiruko to
live and die in the shadows.

02:52.420 --> 02:55.380
It's not too late yet.
You won't be punished...

02:55.920 --> 02:57.960
if you return the
Sacred Dragon Stone.

03:41.220 --> 03:45.220
We shall have that Dragon Stone!

03:46.680 --> 03:47.680
Who are you?

04:01.070 --> 04:03.450
So, this is the
Hiruko ninja way.

04:38.060 --> 04:39.690
This is getting
to be a nuisance.

04:42.440 --> 04:44.110
Can't take this anymore.

04:45.320 --> 04:46.780
What a noise!

05:06.840 --> 05:07.970
Here!

05:13.640 --> 05:15.160
Don't waste your energy.

05:15.190 --> 05:17.400
You can't get away.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.330
I'll ask one more time.

05:20.360 --> 05:21.480
Who are you?

05:22.360 --> 05:23.690
I don't know.

05:24.070 --> 05:25.700
I see.

05:26.740 --> 05:28.070
Then die!

05:37.710 --> 05:41.960
How does he taste, my kids?

05:42.920 --> 05:45.220
Don't waste a piece. Eat it all.

05:57.480 --> 05:58.650
Mozuku...

06:00.610 --> 06:03.440
No time to worry about others.

06:17.160 --> 06:20.420
I want you to be our meal.

06:22.460 --> 06:23.460
What?

06:32.220 --> 06:34.930
How wonderful, wonderful!

06:36.060 --> 06:39.360
I am delighted your fight
seems to be over so quickly.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.810
Once you are done,
get lost, please!

06:43.820 --> 06:45.660
I am sleepy.

06:45.690 --> 06:48.530
I was having a nice dream.

06:49.570 --> 06:52.490
Then this clink, clink,
clang, clang woke me up.

07:03.460 --> 07:04.960
First, you!

07:13.970 --> 07:15.230
What's the matter?

07:15.260 --> 07:18.240
You can't get me unless
I'm in the range of your sword!

07:18.270 --> 07:20.690
With my sword,
that's not necessary!

07:32.160 --> 07:33.370
Magai?

07:46.960 --> 07:49.420
I've heard about you.

07:50.720 --> 07:54.310
A mercenary ninja who, with a
gust of energy through his sword,

07:54.340 --> 07:56.220
defeats his opponent.

07:57.180 --> 08:00.230
I believe your name
is Jubei Kibagami.

08:01.310 --> 08:05.530
It must be a strange
fate to have met you here.

08:05.560 --> 08:07.540
Would you be
willing to work for me?

08:07.570 --> 08:09.870
- Of course, I will pay.
- I decline.

08:09.900 --> 08:10.900
Why?

08:11.740 --> 08:13.630
You are, after all,
a mercenary ninja.

08:13.660 --> 08:15.790
Don't you work for money?

08:15.820 --> 08:16.950
Yeah, that's right.

08:17.660 --> 08:21.290
But I don't trust a guy
who doesn't show his face.

08:24.460 --> 08:25.710
Where are you going, Jubei?

08:27.710 --> 08:28.710
Nowhere.

08:31.340 --> 08:34.470
I just want to see
the rest of my dream.

08:45.190 --> 08:47.980
Mozuku was defeated.

08:48.860 --> 08:49.860
Who killed him?

08:51.610 --> 08:53.240
N012 Roga?

09:00.490 --> 09:01.490
I see.

09:02.200 --> 09:03.620
The Kimon Clan.

09:04.830 --> 09:06.670
Ninjas working for Yamikubo.

09:11.090 --> 09:13.090
The Light Maiden is in danger!

09:17.140 --> 09:18.180
She's in danger!

09:28.900 --> 09:30.730
Magai was killed.

09:31.190 --> 09:32.480
Let's go, Gouten.

09:39.200 --> 09:42.790
The Light Maiden is in danger.

10:33.960 --> 10:36.180
Yesterday and again, today...

10:36.210 --> 10:38.090
I haven't had much luck.

11:04.580 --> 11:08.050
Miss Shigure, we are
ready for a practice session.

11:08.080 --> 11:09.210
Yes.

11:16.800 --> 11:19.560
- You know, Genza...
- Yes?

11:19.590 --> 11:22.640
I have never been out of this
village, not since I was born.

11:23.800 --> 11:26.690
I wonder what's out there!

11:26.720 --> 11:30.890
Well, I don't
really know myself.

11:32.400 --> 11:33.650
I see.

11:42.530 --> 11:44.590
Come on! Fight!

11:44.620 --> 11:46.370
Fight!

11:47.740 --> 11:48.740
Ready!

12:05.390 --> 12:06.760
Ouch!

12:08.180 --> 12:10.860
How many times do I have to
tell you?! Don't close your eyes!

12:10.890 --> 12:12.060
Y-Yes!

12:14.270 --> 12:17.270
I don't care who—
Someone defeat me!

12:34.750 --> 12:36.130
We are in no
state to fight back.

12:36.750 --> 12:39.800
We can't protect our
village in case of an attack.

12:40.420 --> 12:41.920
You are right.

12:44.720 --> 12:47.980
Genza always
treats me like a child.

12:48.010 --> 12:49.100
But I'm...

12:54.140 --> 12:56.940
- Trespasser!
- M-Miss Shigure?

13:12.580 --> 13:13.750
Yo.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.300
Who are you?

13:16.330 --> 13:17.760
What's the matter?

13:17.790 --> 13:20.010
What a dangerous place.

13:20.040 --> 13:21.380
Look what you've done!

13:26.340 --> 13:28.340
He got in the middle of this.

13:28.800 --> 13:29.850
Did it hit him?

13:30.600 --> 13:31.930
I don't know.

13:32.390 --> 13:34.320
Just got a little lost.

13:34.350 --> 13:36.230
I'd appreciate it if I
can get a drink of water.

13:38.900 --> 13:41.440
All right. Come with me.

14:19.850 --> 14:21.410
Don't worry.

14:21.440 --> 14:23.820
After I get some
rest, I'm out of here.

14:25.150 --> 14:26.190
Tell me something.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.620
What is it?

14:31.450 --> 14:34.080
I know nothing but this village.

14:34.620 --> 14:39.170
I want you to tell me, traveler,
what is out there in the world?

14:40.380 --> 14:42.310
What is different from here?

14:42.340 --> 14:43.630
Not much.

14:44.380 --> 14:48.170
No matter where you go, people
are people, and the sky is the sky.

14:48.840 --> 14:50.680
Nothing's different.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.010
I'm—.

14:59.480 --> 15:00.480
What's that?

15:02.520 --> 15:05.750
Maybe it was someone trying
to catch a baboon with a cannon.

15:05.780 --> 15:06.860
Be serious!

15:14.740 --> 15:16.630
I am getting tired of this.

15:16.660 --> 15:19.330
I guess someone
doesn't want me to sleep.

15:29.420 --> 15:30.510
Mr. Genza!

15:32.640 --> 15:35.720
I'm afraid this is our fate.

16:01.790 --> 16:07.670
The Light Maiden...
The Light Maiden!

16:23.020 --> 16:25.310
Miss Shigure, please
run away! Quick!

16:44.540 --> 16:46.170
Go! Go!

16:49.590 --> 16:53.130
You guys, keep
eating, eat them all!

17:00.520 --> 17:03.530
Hey, you better get out of here.

17:03.560 --> 17:05.140
D-Don't insult me!

17:07.310 --> 17:08.520
I will...

17:10.530 --> 17:12.110
I can...

17:28.210 --> 17:29.460
You guys!

17:30.750 --> 17:33.020
Please, Miss Shigure,
please run away.

17:33.050 --> 17:34.590
We'll take care of things here.

17:36.300 --> 17:37.510
Quick!

17:49.860 --> 17:53.030
You! Are you a
village guardsman?

17:53.570 --> 17:55.370
I have nothing to
do with this village.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.570
I am just passing by.

17:57.490 --> 17:58.750
That's fine.

17:58.780 --> 17:59.990
This is some kind of fate.

18:01.450 --> 18:02.700
I hate this fate.

18:03.490 --> 18:06.210
Genza? Genza?

18:07.500 --> 18:09.640
Where shall I run to?

18:09.670 --> 18:12.720
What shall I do, Genza?

18:12.750 --> 18:15.970
Go to the outside world
which you wish to see.

18:18.590 --> 18:20.300
I will take you.

18:32.190 --> 18:34.110
No!

18:47.750 --> 18:49.210
Run, quick!

18:54.840 --> 18:56.460
Go, quick!

18:59.630 --> 19:01.340
Run away! Quick!

19:25.950 --> 19:30.830
M-Miss Shi... go... re!

19:38.130 --> 19:40.510
You. What's your name?

19:41.220 --> 19:43.260
Jubei Kibagami.

19:55.940 --> 19:58.250
Mother! Don't die!

19:58.280 --> 20:00.280
What'|I happen
to us if you die?!

20:21.880 --> 20:25.470
Jubei... Kibagami.

20:25.890 --> 20:26.890
Yo.

20:27.560 --> 20:33.160
You said you wouldn't trust
someone who hides his face...

20:33.190 --> 20:34.190
Yeah.

20:35.150 --> 20:37.940
This is my face.

20:40.110 --> 20:41.940
I beg you.

20:42.190 --> 20:48.700
I-I want you to
give this to that girl.

20:50.950 --> 20:53.880
Are you sure you want
to trust me with this?

20:53.910 --> 20:56.640
I am a mercenary ninja
who works for money.

20:56.670 --> 20:58.960
Yes, I trust you.

21:01.590 --> 21:04.970
If not, I will haunt you.

21:22.940 --> 21:24.360
The... Light...

21:26.450 --> 21:28.070
Maiden.

23:29.990 --> 23:31.990
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:33.070 --> 23:35.550
The village is in
flames, its people dead.

23:35.580 --> 23:38.000
Isolated, will Shigure
see another dawn?

23:38.700 --> 23:42.180
Gouten of the Kimon Clan,
a human tank, rushes to her.

23:42.210 --> 23:46.720
Meanwhile, Nekome of the Hiruko
closes in on the wandering Jubei.

23:46.750 --> 23:53.400
As the flower cries out in rage,
steel is bared in an empty inn.

23:53.430 --> 23:57.030
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Departure.

23:57.060 --> 23:58.400
<i>Episode 2 Departure Witness.</i>

23:58.430 --> 23:59.980
<i>Episode 2 Departure</i>
